2. Supported versions. We want everyone on a version we can keep
   secure and reliable. Each version of MockMason is supported
   while it remains available from our official download page.
   When a newer version replaces it and the older version is
   withdrawn, the older version is no longer supported, and
   MockMason will let you know the next time it starts.

3. Staying up to date. MockMason periodically checks online to see
   whether a newer version is available. If it has been unable to
   reach the internet for a reasonable period of time, it will ask
   you to connect before you continue, so that your experience
   stays on the latest version. These periodic checks are required.

4. When a version is no longer supported. Your permission to use
   that version ends. To continue, update to a supported version.
   If you prefer not to update, please stop using that version and
   uninstall it.

5. Updates to these terms. If these terms change in a new version,
